        "id": 1125653
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-26T06:21:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Changing a user-visible thing like this (i.e. a user/kernel abi) in a released kernel series should almost never be done.  Please work with the proper people and security teams to ensure that this really is needed for this already-released kernel tree, AND to ensure that it will not break any of the existing systems out there in the wild.\n\nHow are you ensuring that this will not be considered a regression on any device currently being used?",
      "parentUuid": "48c5d912_243d7523",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 60
      },
